    "title": "Rate-half distance-three pair-locator Mobius dichotomy",
    "status": "PROVED",
    "closure": "proof",
    "statement": "For at least two disjoint exceptional pairs, their distinct monic quadratic locators span dimension two or three. Dimension two holds exactly when all pairs are two-cycles of one common nonidentity Mobius involution; otherwise the pair-locator span has dimension three. This classifies but does not exclude the Mobius branch on the official subgroup.",
